  "content": "<h4><i></i>Weather Alert</h4>\n        \n    \n                    <pre>...FREEZE WARNING IN EFFECT FROM 1 AM TO 9 AM CDT SATURDAY...\n\n* WHAT...Sub-freezing temperatures as low as 31 expected.\n\n* WHERE...Wapello County.\n\n* WHEN...From 1 AM to 9 AM CDT Saturday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Frost and freeze conditions could kill crops, other\nsensitive vegetation and possibly damage unprotected outdoor\nplumbing.\n\nPRECAUTIONARY/PREPAREDNESS ACTIONS...\n\nTake steps now to protect tender plants from the cold.\n\n&amp;&amp;\n\n</pre>\n                \n\n\n    \n        \n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n        \n            <a>\n                \n                \n            </a>\n            \n                \n                    \n                        <i></i>\n                        <i></i>\n                    \n                \n                \n                    <a>\n                        \n                    </a>\n                    \n                        \n                    \n                    \n                        \n                            <h4></h4>\n                            \n                        \n                    \n                    \n                \n            \n        \n        \n    \n        \n            <p>AP \n            </p>\n        \n        \n    \n    \n    <p>\n            <ul>\n        <li>Dark Matter Technologies</li>\n        \n        \n            <li>\n        <time datetime=\"2026-10-16T05:08:38-05:00\">\n            Oct 16, 2026\n        </time></li>\n            <li>\n        <time datetime=\"2026-10-16T05:08:38-05:00\">5 hrs ago</time></li>\n        \n        \n            \n        \n        \n    </ul>\n        \n    </p>\n    \n    \n    \n\n        \n        \n            \n        \n    \n\n    \n        \n            \n            \n            <figure>\n                \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            <p><img src=\"https://bloximages.chicago2.vip.townnews.com/ottumwacourier.com/content/tncms/assets/v3/editorial/e/c5/ec57a671-1619-5f5f-8e0d-ff27a3221638/6ad1f7f3e05cc.image.jpg?resize=400%2C300\" alt=\"Dark Matter Technologies names new CTO, CFO and general counsel\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" />\n            </p>\n            \n                \n                \n                    <figcaption>\n                            \n                                \n                                    <p>IMAGE CAPTION: Dark Matter Technologies names new CTO, CFO and general counsel | Dark Matter Technologies, an innovative leader in home lending technology, today announced the promotions of Don Oliver to chief technology officer, Chris Medvidofsky to chief financial officer and Blaine Prober to general counsel. All three have been with Dark Matter since it launched in 2023. The timing reflects how the company has built its leadership team: supporting people's growth within the organization when they demonstrate experience, leadership and a customer-first mindset.</p>\n                                \n                            \n                        \n                            \n                                \n                                    Send2Press\n                                \n                            \n                        \n                        \n                    </figcaption>\n                \n            \n        </figure>\n\n            \n\n            \n                \n\n                \n                            \n\n                            \n\n\n\n                            \n                                \n                                \n        \n        \n                                \n        \n        \n                                <p>- <em>Promotions of Don Oliver, Chris Medvidofsky and Blaine Prober follow recent senior hires to round out a